  C("Why can’t human imagination ground the possibility of unicorns?", ["Because unicorns were possible before anyone imagined them", "Because imagination is material", "Because unicorns are impossible", "Because only scientists can ground possibilities"], 0, "Imagining a unicorn discovers a possibility; it does not create it.", "understand")
