  C("Feser says abstract objects cannot ultimately depend on human intellects. Does this mean they do not exist in human minds at all?", ["Yes — they exist only in God", "No — they exist in human minds when we think, but human minds are not their ultimate ground", "Yes — human minds only contain sentences", "No — they exist only in material things"], 1, "Step 9 says abstract objects exist in contingent intellects too; the claim is about ultimate dependence.", "analyze"),
